<title>CROATIA: WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WEIGHTLIFTING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIJEKA, Croatia 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the European</p>
<p>weightlifting championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Over 108 kg</p>
<p>1. Tibor Stark (Hungary) snatch 190.0 kg/clean and jerk 230.0</p>
<p>kg/total lift 412.5 kg</p>
<p> 2. Raimonds Bergmanis (Latvia)   182.5/230.0/407.5</p>
<p> 3. Stian Grimseth (Norway)	 190.0/222.5/405.0</p>
</text>
